WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:05,090
I know these words will be exchanged for even worse words.

2
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:06,620
But today

3
00:00:07,370 --> 00:00:08,650
I want to be willful for once

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,900
When I was sick as a child

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,720
My brother said that sick people have the right to be willful

6
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,270
You just called me a harsh uncle

7
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:37,240
Now there are decorations

8
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,200
I recommended the person

9
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,540
It is mostly not easy to pass the S exam

10
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,020
Can't let him die

11
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:51,020
you are a family member

12
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:54,690
I'm his colleague. Is it okay?

13
00:00:55,830 --> 00:00:56,830
Please inform his family
